## Original Content
"Acho que estamos agora num ponto de viragem que vai determinar a nossa trajetória futura, mas parece que estamos a perder terreno gradualmente, lentamente", afirmou.

## Summary
Fedorov states that Ukraine is at a crucial turning point in the war but is slowly losing ground gradually. He expresses concern that this gradual decline will determine the future trajectory of the conflict.

## Key Points
- Ukraine is at a turning point in the war that will shape its future.
- The country is losing territory gradually and slowly.
- The situation is described as a slow loss, indicating a pessimistic outlook.
- Fedorov's comments highlight the critical nature of the current phase in the conflict.


